		<published>2023-03-14T00:21:04</published>
		<id>http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2750&amp;p=22591#p22591</id>
		<link href="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2750&amp;p=22591#p22591"/>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[TYT MD-380 / RT-3 - Not supported [FM only sources]]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2750&amp;p=22591#p22591"><![CDATA[
Current Status  - Not supported<br><br>This radio is not currently be supported because it uses an older DMR IC   ( HR-C5000 ) which does not function the same as the HR-6000 in the supported radios.<br><br>Known problems with the HR-C5000 are :<br><br>* Existing DMR source code, written for the HR-C6000 does not work with the HR-C5000. The IC hardware interface, registers and commands, for DMR operation is different; This functionality would need to be written from scratch.<br>* Does not support FM CTCSS Tx or Rx; This functionality would need to be written from scratch using the CPU<br>* Does not support FM DTMF; This functionality would need to be written from scratch using the CPU<br>* Does not suport the "OpenMusic" channel used in the firmware for beeps; This functionality would need to be written from scratch using the CPU<br><br><br>The amount of work / time require to support this radio is large, and none of the active developers have the time or interest work on converting the firmware to work with this old radio.<br><br><br>Sources for the FM only UHF MD-380 / RT-3 can now be downloaded from here<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/releases/MD380/R20230319_UHF_FM_ONLY" class="postlink">downloads/releases/MD380/R20230319_UHF_FM_ONLY</a><br><br>These sources are not totally in sync with the latest UV380 sources but the radio does transmit and receive on UHF FM<br><br>Thanks to Colin G4EML for all his work getting the MD-380 even to work on FM, as this radio has completely different RF hardware to the UV380<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Mar 14, 2023 12:21 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
